llm_calls.user_prompt:
## 1. Verified KPI Targets

Goal: Reduce the waiting time for loan applications before validation while ensuring overall application completion is expedited.

  1. Average Loan Application Cycle Time [time] — minimize (scope: end_to_end)
  2. Average Waiting Time Before Validation [time] — minimize (scope: activity_level)

Reasoning: This KPI set effectively addresses the simulation goal by focusing on reducing waiting times before validation and overall cycle times for loan applications. The first KPI measures the average cycle time, while the second KPI specifically targets waiting times before validation. The third KPI segments waiting times by application variant, allowing for targeted improvements based on evidence-supported differences. All KPIs are grounded in the provided event log evidence, ensuring they are measurable and relevant.

These KPIs have been human-verified. Minimize/maximize KPIs are your optimisation targets. Maintain KPIs are constraints — your scenario must not degrade them.

